@startuml cu79
!theme plain
title CU79 — Administrar Plantillas de Trámite

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) requests to manage procedure templates.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows the list of existing templates with types and status.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) chooses to create a new template or edit an existing one.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Asks to select the procedure type and shows the document catalog.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects the procedure type and composes the document list.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Validates the selection and presents the documents with required and validity options.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) confirms the template configuration.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Saves the template, checks for duplicates, and confirms successful registration.
System -> System : System

@enduml
